WEBVTT

00:09:58.135 --> 00:10:01.889
we will wonder how we ever accepted

00:10:01.889 --> 00:10:03.223
or tolerated

00:10:03.223 --> 00:10:06.352
94 percent of crashes

00:10:06.352 --> 00:10:07.853
being caused by human [error].

00:10:09.313 --> 00:10:10.898
So with computer vision,

00:10:10.898 --> 00:10:12.066
we have the opportunity

00:10:12.066 --> 00:10:16.320
to move from problem-solving
to problem-preventing.

00:10:17.112 --> 00:10:19.907
And I truly, truly believe

00:10:19.907 --> 00:10:24.703
that the next generation
of scientists and technologists

00:10:24.703 --> 00:10:26.830
in, yes, Silicon Valley,

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:28.374
but in Paris,

00:10:28.374 --> 00:10:29.958
in Senegal, West Africa

00:10:29.958 --> 00:10:31.293
and all over the world,